# Build output
/build/
/.pio/
compile_commands.json
/out.png

# Editor / LSP index caches (clangd writes .cache/clangd from compile_commands)
.cache/

# Generated assets (regenerate with: python3 tools/gen_assets.py)
/src/generated/

# Host preview dumps
*.ppm
*.bmp

# Host persistence file (FileSaveStore writes the save blob to the cwd)
/malwarium_save.bin

# Generated preview-panel snapshot gallery (regenerated by tools/run.sh)
/tools/preview_page/*.png

# NOTE: include/config.h is COMMITTED — it holds the verified device pinout
# (the bring-up result), now authoritative rather than a per-machine template.

# Assistant tooling is not part of the project. CLAUDE.md and .claude/ are prompts,
# agent definitions and editor settings — they help write the code, they are not the
# code, and a reader should never need them to understand this repo. Everything they
# carried that describes the PROJECT lives in tracked docs instead: CONTRIBUTING.md
# (constraints, module rule, standards routing), the per-folder README.md files, and
# tools/gates.sh (the build/test cycle, previously a snippet to copy by hand).
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Python tooling
.venv/
__pycache__/

# macOS
.DS_Store
/dist/

# Art with no consumer, parked out of the compiled atlas (see assets/_attic/README.md).
/assets/_attic/
